OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, clear start with risk
OL,6,Fof frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,7,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,8,Fsunshine and just a few patches of
OL,9,Fcloud.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and settled overnight
OL,12,Fwith light winds and largely clear
OL,13,Fskies. Turning cold again, with frost
OL,14,Fdeveloping in places along with a few
OL,15,Ffog patches.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAnother cold start with frost
OL,18,Fin places and any fog patches quickly
OL,19,Fclearing. Remaining dry and settled
OL,20,Fduring the day with plenty of sunshine
OL,21,Fand light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
